{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/708218-the-gauntlet","id":708218,"title":"The Gauntlet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-18T23:22:52-07:00","id":708218,"title":"The Gauntlet","content":"In which book can I find more information on the gauntlet? Specifically, how quickly does it repair itself after being weakened or strengthened by the shartha?<br /> <br /> Also, the\u200b Beshilu's ability to bore through it seems a bit... powerful. winnowing down the rating at a rate of 1 level per hour in a 10sq yard area for a creature that doesn't sleep seems... steep.<br /> <br /> Sorry, this isn't particularly articulate as its late and i'm tired, but... yeah.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-19T17:20:45-07:00","id":709576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gnomish American</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/708218-the-gauntlet#post708218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, the\u200b Beshilu's ability to bore through it seems a bit... powerful. winnowing down the rating at a rate of 1 level per hour in a 10sq yard area for a creature that doesn't sleep seems... steep.</div> </div> </div> </div>Reading the book it looks like the shard needs to at least gain a host first before gaining this ability. So not every single shard has that ability just those who have nested in a corpse. A Beshilu infestation is a disaster though. <br /> <br /> As for books, you can always buy &quot;Predators&quot;. It has a whole chapter on host's and how they operate. Those mechanics and story ideas may change though with new publications.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8619-aforgeforthoughts","name":"AForgeForThoughts","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-19T18:12:06-07:00","id":709661,"title":"","content":"Yeah I don't know of any rules for how the Gauntlet heals, though I believe there's some abilities to alter the rating and know there's a fetish to heal it in first edition.<br /> <br /> I think the steepness of it, though, is meant to show what a danger they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-19T22:21:43-07:00","id":709966,"title":"","content":"Thanks guys, When I woke up I remembered some of the rules from way back when (writing while sleepy is less than useful <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />). I seem to remember that the gauntlet heals a level after a number of days equal to the level being healed. (an inner city gauntlet gnawed down to 1 would heal back to five after 2+3+4+5 (14) days.<br /> <br /> I guess i'm just miffed (\u200bsaddened?) that one cannot have an ancient Beshilu presence in a city without that city turning into the ending of ghostbusters (tell me the ghosts aren't more like spirits)<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Call Me <b>Ray</b>.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://southern-gothic.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Southern Gothic </a>- Welcome to New Calais","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/256-gnomish-american","name":"Gnomish American","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar256_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-20T01:18:56-07:00","id":710135,"title":"","content":"Well, in Predators the Gnaw Gauntlet power is mentioned to only be able to get the penalty down to +0, so no loci or verges there. It just makes the Gauntlet Breach manifestation easier to use.<br /> <br /> It also says that &quot;once the gauntlet has weakened, it will remain so until circumstances change it's density once more, which may take months or years&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5